The files in fixtures/ are test files of RosettaSciIO
(https://github.com/hyperspy/rosettasciio), from rsciio/tests/data/mrc/ at its
tag v0.15.0, written by Direct Electron's DE-Server:

- fixtures/acquisition_274/: the files 20241021_00405_*, unchanged.
- fixtures/lone_info_272/20230925_01497_info.txt: info.txt, unchanged, renamed
  after its Dataset Name.
- fixtures/xy_scan_275/: Custom_info.txt, Custom_movie.mrc and
  Custom_scan_coordinates.csv, unchanged, renamed 20250429_06699_info.txt,
  20250429_06699_0_movie.mrc and 20250429_06699_scan_coordinates.csv after their
  Dataset Name.

The generated fixtures (generate.py) are copies of acquisition_274's files,
renamed or with one line added.

